@node channel-mute-solo Plugin Developer Guide
@section Developer Guide

SOTF Channel Mute/Solo plugin for per-channel mute, solo, and dim.

Provides independent mute, solo, and dim controls for each audio channel with smoothed gain transitions (~5ms fade) to avoid clicks.

@subsubheading Parameter wiring

All parameters reach the audio thread through the host's @code{rebuild_cached_parameters} / @code{set_parameter} / @code{get_parameter} triad. Structural parameters (marked in the notes below) trigger a rebuild; the rest update in real time with zero dropouts.

